amai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109680/extras/607b74d3757cd1391d5eba4ec7435783.webm?t=1762187907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109680/extras/607b74d3757cd1391d5eba4ec7435783.mp4?t=1762187907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109680/extras/e7cfe2c24611187a689de741e427641b.webp?t=1762187907\" width=615 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Claim a spot whether it is a cliffside, riverside, deep forest and build wooden walls, floors, and ramps to raise your first base. Gather wood, stone, and ore to craft better tools and weapons, stepping up from rough stone to sturdier gear and early firepower. Expand, reinforce, and turn a shelter into a launchpad for longer expeditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109680/extras/8a17f9c3332cca177a3f28d68e5b3238.webp?t=1762187907\" width=606 height=51 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109680/extras/cf9ab29036d09a6b18da0990d8024779.poster.avif?t=1762187907\" width=630 height=354 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109680/extras/cf9ab29036d09a6b18da0990d8024779.webm?t=1762187907\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109680/extras/cf9ab29036d09a6b18da0990d8024779.mp4?t=1762187907\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109680/extras/e7cfe2c24611187a689de741e427641b.webp?t=1762187907\" width=615 height=56 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go it alone or team up online. Share materials, revive each other mid-fight, and tackle tougher ruins together. Coordinate roles and push deeper as a squad to restore more of the island and uncover what brought this utopia to its knees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>WISHLIST ELYSIUM TO FOLLOW THE JOURNEY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is waking up. Be there when it does.</p>","developers":["Artifika Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2354810","name":"Elysium"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109680/93c4345d2a4cbd5606df5d89923ee87065c2de97/header.jpg?t=1762187907","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4109680/514045313/2767104bc49f9cdb21ae97c324ebe0b644fbc0cd/1762114861/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762118603","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4109680/514045313/2767104bc49f9cdb21ae97c324ebe0b644fbc0cd/1762114861/dash_h264.mpd?t=1762118603","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4109680/514045313/2767104bc49f9cdb21ae97c324ebe0b644fbc0cd/1762114861/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1762118603","id":257225853,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257225853/movie480.mp4?t=1762118603","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257225853/movie_max.mp4?t=17621